* {{IPA|/ˈtrɛːpa/|lang=is}}
* {{rhymes|ɛːpa|lang=is}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-strong|drap|drápu|drepið}}

# {{context|ambitransitive|with accusative|lang=is}} to [[beat]], [[hit]]
# {{context|ambitransitive|with accusative|lang=is}} to [[kill]]
#: ''Ég '''drap''' hestinn.''
#:: I '''killed''' the horse.
